OHOS: translate the document-picker/file-export error strings this port adds to
ImageEditingWindow/ScreenshotPinnedWindow.

Both windows save their recognition result or pinned image through the
OHOS document-picker authorization flow (see the userfileexportqueue and
screenshotpinnedwindow/imageeditingexportcontroller patches); the strings kept
here are the OHOS-specific messages for that path. The pinned-window group
manager, the selection controller, the window-group switcher and most of
ImageEditingWindow's own UI text that the unpatched catalog already carries
have no OHOS-specific behavior change, so this port does not translate them.

